<p data-start="26" data-end="64">We finally found the visual direction.</p>
<p data-start="66" data-end="161">First step is <strong data-start="80" data-end="133">getting the background image into the RAMROD repo</strong>. Don't change any code yet.</p>
<p data-start="163" data-end="191">Save the generated image as:</p>
