<p data-start="223" data-end="335">Then upload <code data-start="235" data-end="253">dashboard-bg.png</code> into the <strong data-start="263" data-end="283">RAMROD repo root</strong> alongside <code data-start="294" data-end="305">style.css</code>, <code data-start="307" data-end="318">script.js</code>, and <code data-start="324" data-end="334">logo.png</code>.</p>
<p data-start="337" data-end="411">Once it's uploaded, send me a screenshot of the repo showing the new file.</p>
